r Dring's profile\" class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-36 pc-height-36 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 animate-o2cZpX outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ pressable-sm-lfVyam showFocus-WVN5uq container-TAtrWj interactive-UkK0V6 avatar-u8q6xB last-JfNEJ_\" tabindex=\"0\" style=\"--scale: 36px;\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-width-36 pc-height-36 pc-justifyContent-center pc-alignItems-center pc-position-relative pc-reset bg-secondary-zsvint flex-auto-Ui4XB2 outline-detail-MZomZU pc-borderRadius-full overflow-hidden-aKGHtM sizing-border-box-tYLTRQ container-TAtrWj\" title=\"Christopher Dring\" style=\"--scale: 36px;\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\"><img class=\"img-OACg1c object-fit-cover-u4ReeV pencraft pc-reset\" src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!5onC!,w_36,h_36,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F2bed8dde-a353-40ba-ab27-7d3f3f38d4ff_1440x960.jpeg\" alt=\"Christopher Dring's avatar\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" draggable=\"false\"></picture></div></div></a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-primary-cPcl_r line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\"><span id=\"base-ui-:rl:\" style=\"min-width: 0px;\"><a class=\"pencraft pc-reset decoration-hover-underline-wbvMef reset-KrJVVF\" href=\"https://substack.com/@christopherdring\">Christopher Dring</a></span></div><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-4 pc-reset\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-Y_KLZk line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\"><time datetime=\"2026-11-09T09:30:54.931Z\" title=\"Nov 9 at 5:30 pm\">15 hours ago</time></div><div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-secondary-Y_KLZk line-height-20-DxeVem font-meta-mBdcth size-11-Pn75Jw weight-medium-W9KlJB transform-uppercase-m8PhL1 reset-KrJVVF meta-jfcJ27\">∙ Paid</div></div></div></div><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-16 pc-paddingY-16 pc-justifyContent-space-between pc-alignItems-center pc-reset flex-grow-zFd_bz border-top-detail-themed-YJg2It border-bottom-detail-themed-SRzuF0 post-ufi\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><div class=\"like-button-container post-ufi-button style-button\"></div></div><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-16 pc-paddingTop-16 pc-reset\"><div class=\"postContentWrapper-MYe7fH\"><div class=\"dt-post-body\"><div class=\"available-content\"><div class=\"body markup\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-block\" data-callout=\"true\"><p><em>Every Monday we do a bonus podcast/newsletter for paid supporters of The Game Business (called Here’s The Dring). This is that edition! If you like The Game Business, why not consider becoming a paid supporter? An annual sub works out at about $2/£1.53 a week. It also supports all our free episodes we do every Tuesday and Thursday. And you will also receive free access to our events, including The Game Business Live in Los Angeles.</em></p></div><p><em><span>Hi there! </span><br><br><span>Welcome back to another week on The Game Business. The major games are starting to come out now (GTA is next week!), and so stay tuned to The Game Business on how these titles performing and, importantly, what they’re doing to console sales.</span></em></p><p><em>Plus! We have interviews with Minecraft developer 4J, and two big indies tell us why they’re daring to go up against GTA 6.</em></p><p><em>But that’s for later in the week. For now, I’m going to analyse Nintendo’s marketing strategy for The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time remake. And give you a round-up of what’s been going on during a busy week for the industry. Enjoy!</em></p><div><hr></div><h2 class=\"header-anchor-post\"><strong>Playing the long game: Generational nostalgia is Nintendo’s secret weapon</strong><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-alignItems-center pc-position-absolute pc-reset header-anchor-parent\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-contents pc-reset pubTheme-yiXxQA\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-reset header-anchor offset-top\" id=\"§playing-the-long-game-generational-nostalgia-is-nintendos-secret-weapon\"></div></div></div></h2><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img can-restack\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Idwt!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc44463ba-3df5-4bb5-a409-15a015c3bc7a_2718x1512.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Idwt!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc44463ba-3df5-4bb5-a409-15a015c3bc7a_2718x1512.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"810\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/c44463ba-3df5-4bb5-a409-15a015c3bc7a_2718x1512.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:810,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:4737210,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.thegamebusiness.com/i/223883590?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc44463ba-3df5-4bb5-a409-15a015c3bc7a_2718x1512.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>I really like the musician Meat Loaf. I’m not making some sort of shameful admission here. I genuinely do.</p><p>Technically, he was a big artist when I was young. His seminal 1993 epic Bat Out of Hell II landed when I was around eight. But like a lot of fans of the Meat, that isn’t where my admiration began. It was the 1977 iconic classic Bat Out of Hell.</p><p>I wasn’t around when that album came out, but my dad was. He was a teenager at the time, and it was one of those records that defined his youth. He played it often while I was growing up. Most vividly, I remember listening to it on the weekly drive to Scouts. I could sing along to every word of Paradise by the Dashboard Light, Two Out of Three Ain’t Bad, and the title track itself… not that I knew what exactly I was singing about (thankfully).</p><p>Just last week, You Took The World Right Out Of My Mouth came on my playlist, and when it finished, my four-year old said he loved it. And the cycle continues.</p><p>Nostalgia is contagious. My dad listening back to his favourite album turned it into one of my favourite albums. My wife really loves the Disney Robin Hood movie, which came out 12 years before she was even born. And that’s because it was her mum’s favourite Disney film.</p><p>I’ve been thinking about this dynamic with the launch of The Legend of Zelda: Ocarina of Time remake. Nintendo hasn’t positioned this game at modern fans. It isn’t pitched at the Breath of the Wild crowd at all. It is aimed squarely at me. The Google ad that turns the clock back to 1998, the UK TV spot matching the exact beats of the original N64 commercial and the pre-order incentives offering replica cardboard N64 boxes… all of it targets the people who were there the first time around. It targets me.</p></div></div><div class=\"visibility-check\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset border-left-detail-themed-ZjWKpy sidebar-RUDMha\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-32 pc-reset\" aria-label=\"Sidebar content\" role=\"complementary\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-24 pc-paddingX-16 pc-paddingY-24 pc-boxShadow-lg pc-reset border-detail-themed-AzlXcJ pc-borderRadius-md container-MuztBl\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-gap-8 pc-alignItems-center pc-reset textContent-ehP43r\"><a href=\"https://www.thegamebusiness.com\" data-native=\"true\" style=\"width: 48px; height: 48px;\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0GpI!,w_96,h_96,c_fill,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep,g_auto/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F6dde9eaf-5af8-4bf9-a870-3e1848d34ffe_3000x3000.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset outline-detail-MZomZU pub-logo-m0IFm6 static-XUAQjT\" alt=\"The Game Business\" name=\"The Game Business\"></a><div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-pub-primary-text-W9yTKq align-center-mURswh line-height-24-eeZ5tT font-pub-section-headings-qk4qjk size-17-PFZl93 weight-bold-imzD1a reset-KrJVVF\">The Game Business Show</div><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-flexDirection-column pc-reset\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-reset color-pub-secondary-text-t5qGXw align-center-mURswh line-height-20-DxeVem font-text-ZbvfPr size-13-v10jRz weight-regular-dVsbRc reset-KrJVVF description-ij0plp\">Christopher Dring hosts interviews, in-depth analysis and special features on what's truly going on in the video games industry.</div><span hidden=\"\" data-testid=\"podcast-description\">Christopher Dring hosts interviews, in-depth a